      <span class="eyebrow">Your Rights</span>
      <h1>Client Bill of Rights<br/><em>&amp; Grievances</em></h1>
      <p>At Sunbright Recovery Center, every person we serve has the right to be treated with dignity and respect, to take part in their own care, and to speak up without fear. If something about your care, or the care of someone you love, doesn’t feel right, we want to hear about it.</p>
